<title>USA: Indentix prevails in patent lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Indentix prevails in patent lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Identix Inc Friday said a federal court in California ruled in its favor in a patent infringement lawsuit brought Digital Biometrics Inc.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the judgment awards Identix its costs and ends the lawsuit that alleged Identix TouchPrint products infringed a patent held by Digital.</p>
</text>
